OL,3,GNEWSAWhat students wish they knew
OL,4,Abefore university
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs thousands of young people prepare to
OL,7,Fleave home for university, students say
OL,8,Fthe biggest challenges are often the
OL,9,Fones that happen outside the lecture
OL,10,Ftheatre.
OL,12,FFor Grace Williamson, who has just
OL,13,Fcompleted her first year at university
OL,14,Fin Edinburgh, learning to live with
OL,15,Fother people was one of the biggest
OL,16,Fadjustments.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
