OL,3,GNEWSAWhat students wish they knew
OL,4,Abefore university
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think sharing space without your
OL,7,Ffamily is always going to be
OL,8,Ffundamentally kind of weird because
OL,9,Feveryone has different routines. One of
OL,10,Fmy house mates used to shower at like 1
OL,11,Fam."
OL,13,FGrace said joining societies and
OL,14,Fattending Freshers' Week helped her
OL,15,Fsettle in, but loneliness was her
OL,16,Fbiggest challenge.
